    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that therapist stuff but it feels pointless. how am i supposed to \"be seen\" when i'm basically just a background character in everyone else's life? it's like i could just stop showing up and the world wouldn't even pause for a second. it's exhausting pretending that i actually matter to anyone.",
